  "title": "Wipro Recognized as a Leader by Everest Group in Healthcare Payer Operations Services PEAK Matrix Assessment 2020",
  "summary": "East Brunswick, New Jersey, USA and Bangalore, India – September 15, 2020: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading global information technology, consulting and business process services company, today announced that it it has been positioned as a Leader in Everest Group’s PEAK Matrix® for Healthcare Payer Operations Service Providers 2020.",
